    "features": "<p><strong>Favored Stunts:</strong> Knock Out, Stomach Strike (1 SP), Takedown</p><p><strong>Stomach Strike (1 Sp):</strong> When the mimic lizard successfully hits a target with its inverted stomach, the target must succeed at an opposed Fighting (Grappling) test. On a fail, the target becomes stuck to the lizard’s stomach, allowing it to drag the target closer and attempt to consume it. Each round, the target may retry the test to break free.</p><p><strong>Talents:</strong> Grappling Style, Misdirection</p><p><strong>Armor + Toughness:</strong> 3</p>",
